  Slug: the-proud
  DisplayName: The Proud
  IconPath: icons/magic/control/buff-strength-muscle-damage-orange.webp
  Description: "Whether out of overconfidence, a desire to protect your comrades,
    or the unslakable thirst for glory, you invite challengers to strike you down.
    You are trained in Intimidation. After you Spark Transcendence, you can boast
    to one enemy within 30 feet to draw its attention; this effect has the auditory,
    emotion, mental, and linguistic traits. Until the start of your next turn, the
    target takes a \u20131 status penalty to attack rolls, damage rolls, and skill
    checks against creatures other than you, and it gains a +1 status bonus to these
    rolls when targeting you. @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: The
    Proud]"
